From 2c88f99a15d5e37940de6544e3e130a5ca8aa2ee
Subject: bevy_winit: refine ModifiersChanged reconcile to per-side attestation
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/bevy/commit/2c88f99a15d5e37940de6544e3e130a5ca8aa2ee
Date: 2026-07-02T15:29:44+01:00

Match the version prepared for upstream (modifiers-reconcile):

- never invent a side: presses are synthesized only for keycodes winit
  attests as pressed (macOS is currently the only backend populating
  per-side state), instead of defaulting unknown sides to the left key.
  On the web this means a modifier held while focus is gained is treated
  as unpressed until a real key event arrives, rather than guessing.
- release a recorded keycode when its group is attested-pressed by a
  different keycode while this one reads unknown (both-sides-held with
  one keyup swallowed).
- group-clear releases unchanged: any recorded keycode of a group whose
  logical modifier reads unpressed is released, on all platforms.
---
